This repository is a performance-focused fork of marked 18.1.3, built for
the make.fun markdown-render-speed-02 bounty. The parser, lexer, tokenizer,
renderer and helpers are derived from marked's sources, with optimizations
(fused inline rendering, block/inline dispatch gates, closer-scan caching,
and a single-paragraph list-item fast path) that keep parse() byte-identical
to marked.parse with default options (GFM on, breaks off).

